(3906870, 555566, 26799, '<td valign="top">Is there a way to make the other portions of the image softer?? I find that the foreground is too sharp where the fog and the bridge are the main elements the foreground is taking away from the message of the image. Could you have cropped most of the bottom portion of the image out?? I don''t know?? Just a suggestion.</td>', 'Is there a way to make the other portions of the image softer?? I find that the foreground is too sharp where the fog and the bridge are the main elements the foreground is taking away from the message of the image. Could you have cropped most of the bottom portion of the image out?? I don''t know?? Just a suggestion.', '2007-07-16 02:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
