(3907117, 555647, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whilst possibly a fairly obvious subject, it is nevertheless well photographed - and it isn''t as obvious as the majority of shots in this one. Perhaps a little clarification might have helped - there isn''t quite the detail one would hope to see in the hair, I think.</td>', 'Whilst possibly a fairly obvious subject, it is nevertheless well photographed - and it isn''t as obvious as the majority of shots in this one. Perhaps a little clarification might have helped - there isn''t quite the detail one would hope to see in the hair, I think.', '2007-07-16 06:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3907120, 553792, 6999, '<td valign="top">I wonder if the point at which those rails vanish mightn''t have been slightly more strongly placed in frame? The feeling is that you lead the eye out of frame, rather than capturing the attention. I like the handling of light, and the sense of shape.</td>', 'I wonder if the point at which those rails vanish mightn''t have been slightly more strongly placed in frame? The feeling is that you lead the eye out of frame, rather than capturing the attention. I like the handling of light, and the sense of shape.', '2007-07-16 06:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3907122, 555283, 6999, '<td valign="top">I wonder if this is actually in the right challenge - although given the difficulty of interpretation of this one - how one photographs something that isn''t there - I have to presume you mean it. Missing, simply? There''s a sense of yearning, certainly. In such a considered image, the vertical distortion - the converging lines, is distracting in tat one expects the flowers to be falling over.</td>', 'I wonder if this is actually in the right challenge - although given the difficulty of interpretation of this one - how one photographs something that isn''t there - I have to presume you mean it. Missing, simply? There''s a sense of yearning, certainly. In such a considered image, the vertical distortion - the converging lines, is distracting in tat one expects the flowers to be falling over.', '2007-07-16 06:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3907125, 554785, 6999, '<td valign="top">The hand! Very strange, comes out like some stencilled addition. Quite haunting, thuogh it might possibly have been given greater prominence in frame.  My real problem with this image is that its a simple framing of a simple stone, and the additions are only of stuff, rather than of photographic consideration - what might have been had you chosen not to fill your viewfinder with the stone, but considered the environment also?</td>', 'The hand! Very strange, comes out like some stencilled addition. Quite haunting, thuogh it might possibly have been given greater prominence in frame.  My real problem with this image is that its a simple framing of a simple stone, and the additions are only of stuff, rather than of photographic consideration - what might have been had you chosen not to fill your viewfinder with the stone, but considered the environment also?', '2007-07-16 06:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3907131, 555635, 31403, '<td valign="top">i hope your education is doing better than mine!  good luck in the challenge - guess we should have shot a chain with fishing line eh?</td>', 'i hope your education is doing better than mine!  good luck in the challenge - guess we should have shot a chain with fishing line eh?', '2007-07-16 06:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
