(3907573, 555644, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image that is creative and nicely done overall.  From the thumbnail view I was thinking, perfect, 10!  After seeing it full size I still like this very much, but wish the last elevated bead was sharply in focus.  Seems to be off the mark just a tad.  The shallow DOF works very well otherwise, and the lighting is wonderful.  Nicely done!  8</td>', 'Wonderful image that is creative and nicely done overall.  From the thumbnail view I was thinking, perfect, 10!  After seeing it full size I still like this very much, but wish the last elevated bead was sharply in focus.  Seems to be off the mark just a tad.  The shallow DOF works very well otherwise, and the lighting is wonderful.  Nicely done!  8', '2007-07-16 11:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3907577, 554857, 29011, '<td valign="top">A great looking shot. The lady wearing black nail polish and all black hat and shirt, so what about dark pants or skirt? because with the rest of the shot having fairly dark colors that bright spot is a little distracting. Great job with the lighting and PP. I''m trying to think for a missing link , but I only see a cool lady Capone 8)<br/>Will be coming back to this one , to find the missing link.</td>', 'A great looking shot. The lady wearing black nail polish and all black hat and shirt, so what about dark pants or skirt? because with the rest of the shot having fairly dark colors that bright spot is a little distracting. Great job with the lighting and PP. I''m trying to think for a missing link , but I only see a cool lady Capone 8)Will be coming back to this one , to find the missing link.', '2007-07-16 11:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3907578, 555604, 29011, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Like your play on words :)</td>', 'Nice idea. Like your play on words :)', '2007-07-16 11:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3907580, 553297, 30049, '<td valign="top">Whichever one it is, it''s most certainly dead.  :)</td>', 'Whichever one it is, it''s most certainly dead.  :)', '2007-07-16 11:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3907596, 555681, 30049, '<td valign="top">Seems rather short lived for a Woody - only 22 when he splintered.  What brought about such an abrupt ending?!  Was he playing with fire again?  They warned him about that as a kid once before, didn''t they?  Oh well...that''s a very nice portrait to remember him by.<br/> <br/> <br/>:P</td>', 'Seems rather short lived for a Woody - only 22 when he splintered.  What brought about such an abrupt ending?!  Was he playing with fire again?  They warned him about that as a kid once before, didn''t they?  Oh well...that''s a very nice portrait to remember him by.  :P', '2007-07-16 11:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3907602, 555252, 30049, '<td valign="top">Did you shoot this thru a car window, or is that area in the top left some flare on your lens?  Certainly a very lovely location...  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Did you shoot this thru a car window, or is that area in the top left some flare on your lens?  Certainly a very lovely location...  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-07-16 11:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3907609, 554882, 29011, '<td valign="top">oh yeah! Missing keys LOL. A nerdy take on the theme. Very different and I like it. I''ve been there and well a pen or pencil comes in handy. <br/>Only some places look overexposed. Tricky exposure with the white backdrop. And dude! clone out that Dell ;)</td>', 'oh yeah! Missing keys LOL. A nerdy take on the theme. Very different and I like it. I''ve been there and well a pen or pencil comes in handy. Only some places look overexposed. Tricky exposure with the white backdrop. And dude! clone out that Dell ;)', '2007-07-16 11:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3907617, 555024, 29011, '<td valign="top">A really nice looking shot. But gotta pinch you about the border ;)<br/>Just a simple thin black one would''ve been perfect. The shot itself has a lot working for it. Cutting out the border sections for the shadows coming out is creative but maybe if there was more room and the anchor points where not touching the sides.<br/> <br/>*edited for spelling<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-07-23 11:48:16.</i></td>', 'A really nice looking shot. But gotta pinch you about the border ;)Just a simple thin black one would''ve been perfect. The shot itself has a lot working for it. Cutting out the border sections for the shadows coming out is creative but maybe if there was more room and the anchor points where not touching the sides. *edited for spelling', '2007-07-16 11:24:09.000000', '2007-07-23 12:48:16.000000', 1),
(3907622, 555547, 29011, '<td valign="top">Cool idea! wondering why more folks didnt try the puzzle link. I shoulda, but wanted to try a chain LOL. Back to your shot...Nice spot lighting, but dont particularly like the textured background, would''ve liked smooth for this one.</td>', 'Cool idea! wondering why more folks didnt try the puzzle link. I shoulda, but wanted to try a chain LOL. Back to your shot...Nice spot lighting, but dont particularly like the textured background, would''ve liked smooth for this one.', '2007-07-16 11:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
