(3908129, 555697, 76430, '<td valign="top">This is about what I was planning to do until I took a totally different path.  i was thinking it would be hard to cut through a chain link and make it look like it broke under stress, but I didn''t even think of using a simple swag lamp type chain to make it easier.  Good background!</td>', 'This is about what I was planning to do until I took a totally different path.  i was thinking it would be hard to cut through a chain link and make it look like it broke under stress, but I didn''t even think of using a simple swag lamp type chain to make it easier.  Good background!', '2007-07-16 14:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
