(3908148, 553291, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good one!  Double-entendre. This doesn''t really look like a cuff-link though, so maybe shrinking it and putting it as decoration with a real cuff-link showing around the edges would be good.  This also looks like a button shirt.  Not voting, no dings.</td>', 'Good one!  Double-entendre. This doesn''t really look like a cuff-link though, so maybe shrinking it and putting it as decoration with a real cuff-link showing around the edges would be good.  This also looks like a button shirt.  Not voting, no dings.', '2007-07-16 14:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3908153, 555338, 64929, '<td valign="top">Love how the dragonfly is shot from the bottom...nice color coordination between the chain links and the eyes of the insect.  The only thing I would eliminate is the thick black border, possibly.<br/>But Bravo on a great capture!  *9*</td>', 'Love how the dragonfly is shot from the bottom...nice color coordination between the chain links and the eyes of the insect.  The only thing I would eliminate is the thick black border, possibly.But Bravo on a great capture!  *9*', '2007-07-16 14:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
