(3908273, 553277, 81390, '<td valign="top">A cool representation of a literal interpretation. Yours is the best idea I''ve seen of an actual split chain, and well-executed to boot. The grain carrying through it all helps, complete with choosing a rusty chain. Nice work!</td>', 'A cool representation of a literal interpretation. Yours is the best idea I''ve seen of an actual split chain, and well-executed to boot. The grain carrying through it all helps, complete with choosing a rusty chain. Nice work!', '2007-07-16 15:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3908300, 555635, 81390, '<td valign="top">Boy, I found a wry grin on my face seeing this one. I just read an article today about kids who are told to get a strong education, and do, only to find their jobs are being outsourced. That or a strong education is impossible to come by for any number of reasons.<br/> <br/>Oh, right, and it''s a very eye-catching photo. Normally I don''t go for text, but it works well here. Also love the clouds reflected in those little slivers of glass. Well done!</td>', 'Boy, I found a wry grin on my face seeing this one. I just read an article today about kids who are told to get a strong education, and do, only to find their jobs are being outsourced. That or a strong education is impossible to come by for any number of reasons. Oh, right, and it''s a very eye-catching photo. Normally I don''t go for text, but it works well here. Also love the clouds reflected in those little slivers of glass. Well done!', '2007-07-16 15:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
