(3909876, 555144, 67258, '<td valign="top">It took me a little while to work out the missing link - the sea - but once I did, it is so darned obvious!  I like the composition, and,unusually for  me, the tilted horizon,  I do feel that it could have done with just a bit more punch to match the jaunty framing.</td>', 'It took me a little while to work out the missing link - the sea - but once I did, it is so darned obvious!  I like the composition, and,unusually for  me, the tilted horizon,  I do feel that it could have done with just a bit more punch to match the jaunty framing.', '2007-07-17 04:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909957, 552497, 64035, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel this meets the challenge. Also, it''s of uninteresting composition and subject.</td>', 'I don''t feel this meets the challenge. Also, it''s of uninteresting composition and subject.', '2007-07-17 07:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909973, 555288, 64035, '<td valign="top">There are quite a lot of pictures of chains in this challenge. Yours at least has the benefit of being technically good. I like the texture on the near links, the blackness of your shadows, and the shallow depth of field.</td>', 'There are quite a lot of pictures of chains in this challenge. Yours at least has the benefit of being technically good. I like the texture on the near links, the blackness of your shadows, and the shallow depth of field.', '2007-07-17 07:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909974, 555681, 64035, '<td valign="top">This made me smile, which is always good. The title is perhaps spelling it out a little literally. Technically, it''s OK, though a bit short of the wow factor. Massive bonus points for not being a picture of a chain.</td>', 'This made me smile, which is always good. The title is perhaps spelling it out a little literally. Technically, it''s OK, though a bit short of the wow factor. Massive bonus points for not being a picture of a chain.', '2007-07-17 07:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909975, 554268, 64035, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. Love the colour, love the water surface that looks almost like brushed steel. Bit tenuous on the "meets challenge" front, but there are far worse.<br/> <br/>Also, it''s not a picture of a chain.</td>', 'Nice picture. Love the colour, love the water surface that looks almost like brushed steel. Bit tenuous on the "meets challenge" front, but there are far worse. Also, it''s not a picture of a chain.', '2007-07-17 07:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909976, 555685, 64035, '<td valign="top">A little bit of sensuality lifts this above almost all the 99 other "chain" photos in the challenge. Technically, it''s all fine apart from the chain itself, which just looks a bit odd.</td>', 'A little bit of sensuality lifts this above almost all the 99 other "chain" photos in the challenge. Technically, it''s all fine apart from the chain itself, which just looks a bit odd.', '2007-07-17 07:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909977, 553297, 64035, '<td valign="top">On the plus side, this is not a chain. In fact, it''s the only Lynx in the challenge. The photo is a little flat, though, and really could be lit better. Still, creditable effort.</td>', 'On the plus side, this is not a chain. In fact, it''s the only Lynx in the challenge. The photo is a little flat, though, and really could be lit better. Still, creditable effort.', '2007-07-17 08:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909980, 554885, 64035, '<td valign="top">I like the line of this photo a lot - good "S" shape. Meets the challenge and is interesting, though I could do with some more dynamism in the colour, and a little more "wow" factor on the eye.</td>', 'I like the line of this photo a lot - good "S" shape. Meets the challenge and is interesting, though I could do with some more dynamism in the colour, and a little more "wow" factor on the eye.', '2007-07-17 08:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909982, 552908, 64035, '<td valign="top">This is close to being excellent. It''s at least a different sort of chain, and also the "life falling apart" imagery is good. I could do with a touch more contrast, lifting the red and dropping the blacks a bit.</td>', 'This is close to being excellent. It''s at least a different sort of chain, and also the "life falling apart" imagery is good. I could do with a touch more contrast, lifting the red and dropping the blacks a bit.', '2007-07-17 08:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909984, 555006, 64035, '<td valign="top">I like the feel a lot - it has the impression of the real "sasquatch" photos, while actually being well put together and carefully taken. Also, and I can''t stress how pleasing this is, it''s not a picture of a chain.</td>', 'I like the feel a lot - it has the impression of the real "sasquatch" photos, while actually being well put together and carefully taken. Also, and I can''t stress how pleasing this is, it''s not a picture of a chain.', '2007-07-17 08:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910013, 552772, 44453, '<td valign="top">good idea but the processing is very aggressive and distracting</td>', 'good idea but the processing is very aggressive and distracting', '2007-07-17 08:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910014, 555701, 64035, '<td valign="top">This isn''t the most technically assured photo in the world - the negative space doesn''t quite work, and the head hovers in the netherspace between "attractively out of focus" and "in focus". Also, the colouring is odd.<br/> <br/>Having said that, it''s a creative and original image.</td>', 'This isn''t the most technically assured photo in the world - the negative space doesn''t quite work, and the head hovers in the netherspace between "attractively out of focus" and "in focus". Also, the colouring is odd. Having said that, it''s a creative and original image.', '2007-07-17 08:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910024, 554923, 64035, '<td valign="top">Very funny! Nice angle, and I like the mix of browns too. Excellent.</td>', 'Very funny! Nice angle, and I like the mix of browns too. Excellent.', '2007-07-17 08:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910025, 555234, 44453, '<td valign="top">very literal...  cool</td>', 'very literal...  cool', '2007-07-17 08:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910026, 555370, 64035, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, with nice composition and great texture. Good light, too.</td>', 'Lovely image, with nice composition and great texture. Good light, too.', '2007-07-17 08:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910027, 555579, 64035, '<td valign="top">Clever, well taken photograph. A very "DPC" photo, but a really good one at that. Love the leaves around the frame.</td>', 'Clever, well taken photograph. A very "DPC" photo, but a really good one at that. Love the leaves around the frame.', '2007-07-17 08:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910040, 555024, 44453, '<td valign="top">It''s a good enough photo not to need a gimmicky border</td>', 'It''s a good enough photo not to need a gimmicky border', '2007-07-17 08:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910230, 555579, 76430, '<td valign="top">Tribute to elsapo, huh?  Nicely meets the challenge.  This is a huge frame.  I think you could have found a better background.  The black squares on the ground detract from it, and a more obviously modern background scene would help it IMHO.</td>', 'Tribute to elsapo, huh?  Nicely meets the challenge.  This is a huge frame.  I think you could have found a better background.  The black squares on the ground detract from it, and a more obviously modern background scene would help it IMHO.', '2007-07-17 11:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910294, 555283, 70000, '<td valign="top">you really like that window don''t you....<br/> <br/>well i do too! the look on your face says so much, the tension in the shirt and the sunflowers and color scheme, what an interesting and dynamic photo. i love it</td>', 'you really like that window don''t you.... well i do too! the look on your face says so much, the tension in the shirt and the sunflowers and color scheme, what an interesting and dynamic photo. i love it', '2007-07-17 11:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910472, 555283, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  I have returned to it several times, trying to figure out what the missing link is here.  It is truly a wonderful photograph, but might have worked better in a Free Study challenge.</td>', 'I love this photo.  I have returned to it several times, trying to figure out what the missing link is here.  It is truly a wonderful photograph, but might have worked better in a Free Study challenge.', '2007-07-17 12:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910501, 552144, 39430, '<td valign="top">Very strange.  I''m not sure I get it.  Cool expressions though.</td>', 'Very strange.  I''m not sure I get it.  Cool expressions though.', '2007-07-17 13:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910502, 555591, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh</td>', 'Nice bokeh', '2007-07-17 13:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910508, 554673, 39430, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this is a missing link.  As far as the photo goes, it looks a little static.  Perhaps using a slower shutter would improve the sense of movement.  The exhaust trail helps though.</td>', 'I''m not sure how this is a missing link.  As far as the photo goes, it looks a little static.  Perhaps using a slower shutter would improve the sense of movement.  The exhaust trail helps though.', '2007-07-17 13:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910509, 555520, 39430, '<td valign="top">I gotta take some lighting pics someday.  This is cool.</td>', 'I gotta take some lighting pics someday.  This is cool.', '2007-07-17 13:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910514, 555252, 39430, '<td valign="top">There''s some wierd editing marks visible at the top left, and the top looks a little odd.  When burning, I always try to use a large brush at low opacity, and paint with many small strokes to reduce visible editing lines.</td>', 'There''s some wierd editing marks visible at the top left, and the top looks a little odd.  When burning, I always try to use a large brush at low opacity, and paint with many small strokes to reduce visible editing lines.', '2007-07-17 13:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910517, 555588, 39430, '<td valign="top">Did she drop her links in the pond?  This image would benefit from a little more contrast in the curves adjustment.</td>', 'Did she drop her links in the pond?  This image would benefit from a little more contrast in the curves adjustment.', '2007-07-17 13:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910521, 555547, 39430, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little flat on this one  I''d prefer to see some detail through the hole, and maybe even have the background darker than the leaf, so the leaf stands out more as the subject.</td>', 'The lighting is a little flat on this one  I''d prefer to see some detail through the hole, and maybe even have the background darker than the leaf, so the leaf stands out more as the subject.', '2007-07-17 13:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910524, 554821, 39430, '<td valign="top">Obvious idea, but very well executed.  Nice bokeh, and good balance, although I''d maybe try a closer crop.</td>', 'Obvious idea, but very well executed.  Nice bokeh, and good balance, although I''d maybe try a closer crop.', '2007-07-17 13:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910526, 555472, 39430, '<td valign="top">Cleverly defined by what''s missing.  The unusual viewpoint for a keyboard is messing with my head.  :)</td>', 'Cleverly defined by what''s missing.  The unusual viewpoint for a keyboard is messing with my head.  :)', '2007-07-17 13:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910527, 553792, 39430, '<td valign="top">I''m not keen on the editing on this, as it''s gone a bit too grainy and contrasty.</td>', 'I''m not keen on the editing on this, as it''s gone a bit too grainy and contrasty.', '2007-07-17 13:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910529, 555631, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, and good use of selective desat.  Not a terribly exciting photo, but not bad.</td>', 'Nice composition, and good use of selective desat.  Not a terribly exciting photo, but not bad.', '2007-07-17 13:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910535, 554889, 55956, '<td valign="top">eheheh this could be the only dnmc of the contest :) 7</td>', 'eheheh this could be the only dnmc of the contest :) 7', '2007-07-17 13:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910537, 555600, 39430, '<td valign="top">Photographically, this photo has a lot missing, with rather dull lighting, low contrast and boringly centred subject.  However, the work you''ve gone to on the costume is nothing short of amazing, and their pose and expression are perfect!  So, you get a good score anyway.  :)</td>', 'Photographically, this photo has a lot missing, with rather dull lighting, low contrast and boringly centred subject.  However, the work you''ve gone to on the costume is nothing short of amazing, and their pose and expression are perfect!  So, you get a good score anyway.  :)', '2007-07-17 13:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910540, 554882, 39430, '<td valign="top">Good product placement.  Sponsorship cheque is in the mail.  :)</td>', 'Good product placement.  Sponsorship cheque is in the mail.  :)', '2007-07-17 13:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910545, 555370, 39430, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Great pose and placement.  I was going to complain about low contrast on the person, but I think I like how you''ve edited it.</td>', 'Very well done.  Great pose and placement.  I was going to complain about low contrast on the person, but I think I like how you''ve edited it.', '2007-07-17 13:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910548, 555122, 39430, '<td valign="top">My only complaint here is that the lighting setup is a bit dull on the plane.  The skull has nice variation in tone, but the plane has come up rather flat and boring in BW, and also a little bit soft, which would be helped by a smaller aperture.</td>', 'My only complaint here is that the lighting setup is a bit dull on the plane.  The skull has nice variation in tone, but the plane has come up rather flat and boring in BW, and also a little bit soft, which would be helped by a smaller aperture.', '2007-07-17 13:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910550, 553885, 39430, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal lighting, but perhaps a more dynamic composition of the chain could help.</td>', 'I like the diagonal lighting, but perhaps a more dynamic composition of the chain could help.', '2007-07-17 13:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910552, 554885, 39430, '<td valign="top">"This photo was discovered as the last shot on the camera before the photographer disappeared...".  I like the shallow DOF, but the focus point seems to be at the back of the head, so the eyes are a little bit fuzzy.</td>', '"This photo was discovered as the last shot on the camera before the photographer disappeared...".  I like the shallow DOF, but the focus point seems to be at the back of the head, so the eyes are a little bit fuzzy.', '2007-07-17 13:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910553, 555639, 39430, '<td valign="top">The sepia treatment leaves nothing much of photographic interest in this photo apart from the flat sign.  Perhaps a different angle would help, showing more of the course in the background, and colour would be nicer I think.</td>', 'The sepia treatment leaves nothing much of photographic interest in this photo apart from the flat sign.  Perhaps a different angle would help, showing more of the course in the background, and colour would be nicer I think.', '2007-07-17 13:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910555, 555207, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice compositional balance, although the very soft lighting makes it a little flat.  I like the shadows in the hole.</td>', 'Nice compositional balance, although the very soft lighting makes it a little flat.  I like the shadows in the hole.', '2007-07-17 13:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910558, 554268, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and nice composition, although I''d opt for a little more on the left, and a little less on the right.  I''m not sure about the colour.  I used to always do this to get around the fact that night photos all come out orange, which is fine to a point, but I don''t think the pink works very well.</td>', 'Nice shot and nice composition, although I''d opt for a little more on the left, and a little less on the right.  I''m not sure about the colour.  I used to always do this to get around the fact that night photos all come out orange, which is fine to a point, but I don''t think the pink works very well.', '2007-07-17 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910561, 555483, 39430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rich colours.  It''s a pity the bee is buried so far in the flower.</td>', 'Beautiful rich colours.  It''s a pity the bee is buried so far in the flower.', '2007-07-17 13:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910567, 555546, 39430, '<td valign="top">Great dynamic composition.  The subject is a little hard to discern - perhaps some very light dodging/burning could help direct the eye a little more around the bottom half of the image.</td>', 'Great dynamic composition.  The subject is a little hard to discern - perhaps some very light dodging/burning could help direct the eye a little more around the bottom half of the image.', '2007-07-17 13:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910569, 554827, 39430, '<td valign="top">I like the viewpoint, and the crop, but it''s a pity the crop results in such a small image.  The subject is quite hidden, but the arms work well to direct the eye in to the middle.</td>', 'I like the viewpoint, and the crop, but it''s a pity the crop results in such a small image.  The subject is quite hidden, but the arms work well to direct the eye in to the middle.', '2007-07-17 13:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910577, 555634, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice twin light setup.  It might help if the metal was a little less contrasty.  To help this, you can setup white reflectors (paper is always good) all around the front of the shoot, so that you can see the texture of the medallion a little better.</td>', 'Nice twin light setup.  It might help if the metal was a little less contrasty.  To help this, you can setup white reflectors (paper is always good) all around the front of the shoot, so that you can see the texture of the medallion a little better.', '2007-07-17 13:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910585, 555213, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and tones.  However, the image is actually really annoying, because it directs the eye to the sign in the middle, but you can''t actually see what the sign is.  The incidental details (person, boat, pidgeon) actually help to add more points of interest in an otherwise abstract photo, so I''m glad you didn''t clone them out.</td>', 'Nice colours and tones.  However, the image is actually really annoying, because it directs the eye to the sign in the middle, but you can''t actually see what the sign is.  The incidental details (person, boat, pidgeon) actually help to add more points of interest in an otherwise abstract photo, so I''m glad you didn''t clone them out.', '2007-07-17 13:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910595, 555604, 39430, '<td valign="top">My garden is like a box of chocolates - it''s all brown.  The sky colour seems a little unnatural, like the white balance is off.  Perhaps this was intentional.</td>', 'My garden is like a box of chocolates - it''s all brown.  The sky colour seems a little unnatural, like the white balance is off.  Perhaps this was intentional.', '2007-07-17 13:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910604, 555682, 39430, '<td valign="top">Great colours and texture.  I hate these black borders, but the occasional image such as this can pull it off without annoying me too much.  This image would be helped a lot to have a subject - some point of interest for the viewers eye to rest on, instead of wandering aimlessly around the empty scene.</td>', 'Great colours and texture.  I hate these black borders, but the occasional image such as this can pull it off without annoying me too much.  This image would be helped a lot to have a subject - some point of interest for the viewers eye to rest on, instead of wandering aimlessly around the empty scene.', '2007-07-17 13:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910612, 555498, 39430, '<td valign="top">This image is very noisy.  To minimise this, take images at your lowest ISO, particularly important for point-and-shoot cameras (not so much of an issue with SLRs).  Also, zoom in and or try to get close to the subject, so you don''t have to crop so much, as this will only make the noise more visible.  Lastly, check that you are exposing correctly.  If you have to boost the levels in software, this will magnify the noise.  Nice monkey expression though.  :)</td>', 'This image is very noisy.  To minimise this, take images at your lowest ISO, particularly important for point-and-shoot cameras (not so much of an issue with SLRs).  Also, zoom in and or try to get close to the subject, so you don''t have to crop so much, as this will only make the noise more visible.  Lastly, check that you are exposing correctly.  If you have to boost the levels in software, this will magnify the noise.  Nice monkey expression though.  :)', '2007-07-17 13:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910623, 555131, 39430, '<td valign="top">Wow, great capture.  The rest of the image is a little too dark for my liking.</td>', 'Wow, great capture.  The rest of the image is a little too dark for my liking.', '2007-07-17 13:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910624, 555099, 39430, '<td valign="top">The crop is unnecessarily large for the subject.</td>', 'The crop is unnecessarily large for the subject.', '2007-07-17 13:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910625, 553985, 71121, '<td valign="top">I love the colours</td>', 'I love the colours', '2007-07-17 13:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
