(3910645, 552524, 39430, '<td valign="top">OK, this is wierd.  It took me a while to see it.  That''s my only comment is that it''s perhaps it''s a little unclear.  Only the guy on the right makes it obvious.</td>', 'OK, this is wierd.  It took me a while to see it.  That''s my only comment is that it''s perhaps it''s a little unclear.  Only the guy on the right makes it obvious.', '2007-07-17 14:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
