(3910653, 555468, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and composition.  Considering the hair (which looks like it will be not be an easy job to wash out), her skin is surprisingly clean and soft looking.  :)  The rocks at the back look a little odd, and the editing has run on to her arm.  However, overall a great image.  You found a great location, and processed the colours really well.</td>', 'Nice colours and composition.  Considering the hair (which looks like it will be not be an easy job to wash out), her skin is surprisingly clean and soft looking.  :)  The rocks at the back look a little odd, and the editing has run on to her arm.  However, overall a great image.  You found a great location, and processed the colours really well.', '2007-07-17 14:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910655, 555532, 39430, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to think of another really bad pun as a comeback, but I''m sorry, I''ve got nothing.  As for the image, incorrect white balance is my pet hate.  In overcast conditions, many cameras require manual switching to cloudy or shade setting to get proper colour reproduction.</td>', 'I''m trying to think of another really bad pun as a comeback, but I''m sorry, I''ve got nothing.  As for the image, incorrect white balance is my pet hate.  In overcast conditions, many cameras require manual switching to cloudy or shade setting to get proper colour reproduction.', '2007-07-17 14:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910657, 552253, 39430, '<td valign="top">Lots of negative space leaves me wondering why.</td>', 'Lots of negative space leaves me wondering why.', '2007-07-17 14:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910659, 554495, 39430, '<td valign="top">Amazing find, although perhaps midday was not the best time to shoot.</td>', 'Amazing find, although perhaps midday was not the best time to shoot.', '2007-07-17 14:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
