(3910665, 554889, 39430, '<td valign="top">Lovely macro, but the shallow dof doesn''t quite reach the lower insect.  Well done to fit the challenge with the chain links.</td>', 'Lovely macro, but the shallow dof doesn''t quite reach the lower insect.  Well done to fit the challenge with the chain links.', '2007-07-17 14:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
