(3910674, 555701, 39430, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, but not so good a photo.  Pay careful to details with your editing - the painted smooth background is very obvious.</td>', 'Clever idea, but not so good a photo.  Pay careful to details with your editing - the painted smooth background is very obvious.', '2007-07-17 14:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
