(3910682, 555531, 39430, '<td valign="top">On one hand, there''s plenty of interesting background stuff to look at, but on the other hand it detracts from the subject of the image.  Perhaps if you could have climbed something, a higher viewpoint could have removed the background clutter.  I see you are already on a hill, which helps.  Probably the most distracting thing for me is the shadow on the left.</td>', 'On one hand, there''s plenty of interesting background stuff to look at, but on the other hand it detracts from the subject of the image.  Perhaps if you could have climbed something, a higher viewpoint could have removed the background clutter.  I see you are already on a hill, which helps.  Probably the most distracting thing for me is the shadow on the left.', '2007-07-17 14:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910687, 555105, 39430, '<td valign="top">Anyone in particular?  All of them?  Or the link between the shin, and the other guy''s *ahem*?  I''m not sure I follow.  With a different crop, it would make a good sports photo (without the guy on the right).</td>', 'Anyone in particular?  All of them?  Or the link between the shin, and the other guy''s *ahem*?  I''m not sure I follow.  With a different crop, it would make a good sports photo (without the guy on the right).', '2007-07-17 14:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
