(3910695, 555644, 39430, '<td valign="top">It''s a little hard to work out what it is, but I think it''s a plug and chain.  It''s a pity the DOF doesn''t quite reach to the lower half of the chain.</td>', 'It''s a little hard to work out what it is, but I think it''s a plug and chain.  It''s a pity the DOF doesn''t quite reach to the lower half of the chain.', '2007-07-17 14:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
