(3915730, 555370, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  the only think that I keep wondering though is what is his left hand doing.  I can''t see it and therefore my attention kind of draws to it.  The gentle balck and white though is a great idea and the photo itself was shot very well.  Someone really needs to shave that man!!</td>', 'Very nice capture.  the only think that I keep wondering though is what is his left hand doing.  I can''t see it and therefore my attention kind of draws to it.  The gentle balck and white though is a great idea and the photo itself was shot very well.  Someone really needs to shave that man!!', '2007-07-18 18:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915737, 555684, 75651, '<td valign="top">To be honest, I feel that it is a very average photo.  The idea of missing like is portrayed, but the creativity is what hinders it.  It meets the challenge and the quality of photo is still pretty good though. Nice</td>', 'To be honest, I feel that it is a very average photo.  The idea of missing like is portrayed, but the creativity is what hinders it.  It meets the challenge and the quality of photo is still pretty good though. Nice', '2007-07-18 18:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
