(3916513, 555229, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot; has a hazed, kind of polaroid feel, especially with that red saturation. The white thing - house? home, even? caravan? - almost looks like a smple imperfection.</td>', 'Interesting shot; has a hazed, kind of polaroid feel, especially with that red saturation. The white thing - house? home, even? caravan? - almost looks like a smple imperfection.', '2007-07-18 21:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3916529, 555605, 6999, '<td valign="top">Given the very basic composition, and the contrasty light here, one is tempted to think this is simply about the missing rings on the ladder. Yet the angles of the composition make me wonder if there isn''t more to it. I''m not sure what, though. Maybe that''s me, and maybe it isn''t there ...</td>', 'Given the very basic composition, and the contrasty light here, one is tempted to think this is simply about the missing rings on the ladder. Yet the angles of the composition make me wonder if there isn''t more to it. I''m not sure what, though. Maybe that''s me, and maybe it isn''t there ...', '2007-07-18 22:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3916538, 554129, 6999, '<td valign="top">Ominous title; and ominous clouds to go with it. The repetition of the diagonals is quite effective - edge of building, line of cloud, angle of bird''s wings. Enough grace, compositionally - enough real sense of finesse? I''m not quite convinced, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Ominous title; and ominous clouds to go with it. The repetition of the diagonals is quite effective - edge of building, line of cloud, angle of bird''s wings. Enough grace, compositionally - enough real sense of finesse? I''m not quite convinced, I''m afraid.', '2007-07-18 22:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3916548, 553985, 6999, '<td valign="top">It took me a moment to connect the field with the farm/factory/storage facility thing. Which makes the link ''humanity'', and which in turn makes for an interesting subject - all ''humanity'' being interesting, naturally. The edge light on the plants is perhaps a bit camp, but there''s also a certain sense of ''red weed'' that makes for interesting allusions.</td>', 'It took me a moment to connect the field with the farm/factory/storage facility thing. Which makes the link ''humanity'', and which in turn makes for an interesting subject - all ''humanity'' being interesting, naturally. The edge light on the plants is perhaps a bit camp, but there''s also a certain sense of ''red weed'' that makes for interesting allusions.', '2007-07-18 22:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3916576, 555370, 6999, '<td valign="top">You know, if this was a Robert Mapplethorpe photograph its connotations would be entirely different. The simple visibility of background prevents it being such, however. Oh, and the banana. It''s more an indictment of dpc that this seems simply simplistic and even a little ... I don''t quite know the word: unsympathetic, dystopian perhaps. I wish I didn''t see a a certain crassness in it - I mean, the banana for heaven''s sake - but I''m afraid I do. I''ll be very very interested to see where this rates: its actually a true assessment of style versus content.</td>', 'You know, if this was a Robert Mapplethorpe photograph its connotations would be entirely different. The simple visibility of background prevents it being such, however. Oh, and the banana. It''s more an indictment of dpc that this seems simply simplistic and even a little ... I don''t quite know the word: unsympathetic, dystopian perhaps. I wish I didn''t see a a certain crassness in it - I mean, the banana for heaven''s sake - but I''m afraid I do. I''ll be very very interested to see where this rates: its actually a true assessment of style versus content.', '2007-07-18 22:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3916604, 555131, 64795, '<td valign="top">Oh Boy! This is my favorite so far. 10+ <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=557388" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/64795/thumb/557388.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/64795/thumb/557388.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/64795/thumb/557388.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Oh Boy! This is my favorite so far. 10+ ', '2007-07-18 22:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
