(3918881, 555638, 65319, '<td valign="top">The clarity of this photo and the colors are just stunning.  I love the composition.  I wish I had a photo this good in my own collection.  Outstanding!</td>', 'The clarity of this photo and the colors are just stunning.  I love the composition.  I wish I had a photo this good in my own collection.  Outstanding!', '2007-07-19 16:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919023, 555579, 29011, '<td valign="top">Awesome! really great job :D <br/>With the title as such I see the portal as the missing link so I see the link in the shot. I do like the idea a whole lot and will come back to think about this one more.<br/> <br/>edit: Well the missing link could be the person or whatever placed the portals there. Btw, cool wig and congrats and getting this shot in public LOL. Did you get on lookers?</td>', 'Awesome! really great job :D With the title as such I see the portal as the missing link so I see the link in the shot. I do like the idea a whole lot and will come back to think about this one more. edit: Well the missing link could be the person or whatever placed the portals there. Btw, cool wig and congrats and getting this shot in public LOL. Did you get on lookers?', '2007-07-19 17:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919026, 555337, 29011, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. The soft glow, the light, model, makeup and composition. All the details come together perfectly.<br/>Reckon this will surely make the top5. Good luck :)</td>', 'This is wonderful. The soft glow, the light, model, makeup and composition. All the details come together perfectly.Reckon this will surely make the top5. Good luck :)', '2007-07-19 17:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
