(3920813, 555483, 39243, '<td valign="top">stunning photo - my original comments are in () but after going through all of the photos I guess my missing link was a wee bit constrained- lots of takes on this "missing link" thing. Need to expand my horizons so you get an 8  (its a stretch for the challenge but it kinda works - the best part is you get to share such a stunning photo - i would have scored higher in the Free Study 2007-07 as is a 7)</td>', 'stunning photo - my original comments are in () but after going through all of the photos I guess my missing link was a wee bit constrained- lots of takes on this "missing link" thing. Need to expand my horizons so you get an 8  (its a stretch for the challenge but it kinda works - the best part is you get to share such a stunning photo - i would have scored higher in the Free Study 2007-07 as is a 7)', '2007-07-20 03:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
