(3921675, 552788, 76094, '<td valign="top">LOVE this picture...</td>', 'LOVE this picture...', '2007-07-20 13:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922163, 554261, 50695, '<td valign="top">The pose is perfect. He seems as burdened as the metal men are, but he is clearly shifting his weight, moving, escaping "The Line", becoming the missing link by escaping. I wonder if this is selective desaturation or he just happened to be the only colorful thing in the picture. I''d be interested to see it in black and white. Would the subtler image be more powerful or lose its power? I tend to believe the former, but I could be wrong. Regardless, an intriguing image and one of a handful of truly creative interpretations of the challenge.</td>', 'The pose is perfect. He seems as burdened as the metal men are, but he is clearly shifting his weight, moving, escaping "The Line", becoming the missing link by escaping. I wonder if this is selective desaturation or he just happened to be the only colorful thing in the picture. I''d be interested to see it in black and white. Would the subtler image be more powerful or lose its power? I tend to believe the former, but I could be wrong. Regardless, an intriguing image and one of a handful of truly creative interpretations of the challenge.', '2007-07-20 15:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922174, 554600, 50695, '<td valign="top">Wonderful visual joke here. Does the man look at the monkey or does the man look at his own monkey-nature?</td>', 'Wonderful visual joke here. Does the man look at the monkey or does the man look at his own monkey-nature?', '2007-07-20 15:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922183, 552047, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love this tableau. A great diagonal composition highlights the dramatic victim oppressed beneath the cold gazes of his onlookers, which run from indifference to bemusement to downright condemnation. The "missing link" here is empathy. This has all the effectiveness of a scalvert set up, but much more realism, even though we know it isn''t real.</td>', 'I love this tableau. A great diagonal composition highlights the dramatic victim oppressed beneath the cold gazes of his onlookers, which run from indifference to bemusement to downright condemnation. The "missing link" here is empathy. This has all the effectiveness of a scalvert set up, but much more realism, even though we know it isn''t real.', '2007-07-20 15:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922197, 555370, 50695, '<td valign="top">very good job creating an anthropological/archaeological "look." The only hint of civilization here is that he peeled the banana and is holding it rather delicately. One wonders if this isn''t early man on the brink of civilization. He does seem to be pausing. It could be the very moment that our furry Adam decided life could be better. "What other bananas are out there for me to peel?" The missing link between cave man and city man.</td>', 'very good job creating an anthropological/archaeological "look." The only hint of civilization here is that he peeled the banana and is holding it rather delicately. One wonders if this isn''t early man on the brink of civilization. He does seem to be pausing. It could be the very moment that our furry Adam decided life could be better. "What other bananas are out there for me to peel?" The missing link between cave man and city man.', '2007-07-20 15:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922201, 555532, 50695, '<td valign="top">The golf joke seemed less clever every time it came up, but I like how you''ve combined golf with the other meaning in such a ludicrous fashion. Also, it looks like he''s wearing velvet. Any caveman in velvet and glasses deserves at least an 8.</td>', 'The golf joke seemed less clever every time it came up, but I like how you''ve combined golf with the other meaning in such a ludicrous fashion. Also, it looks like he''s wearing velvet. Any caveman in velvet and glasses deserves at least an 8.', '2007-07-20 15:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922209, 555006, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve recreated the feel of those Big Foot photos, but this goes even further, has an almost Victorian feel to it, like a "Varney the Vampire" illustration. Much enjoyed.</td>', 'I like how you''ve recreated the feel of those Big Foot photos, but this goes even further, has an almost Victorian feel to it, like a "Varney the Vampire" illustration. Much enjoyed.', '2007-07-20 16:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922214, 552908, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the dreariness and bloodiness of this. It almost seems like an organic process, or rather organ failure.</td>', 'I like the dreariness and bloodiness of this. It almost seems like an organic process, or rather organ failure.', '2007-07-20 16:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922219, 554153, 50695, '<td valign="top">very good b/w conversion. this has a real mood to it. Reminds me of Enigma comics from the 90s.</td>', 'very good b/w conversion. this has a real mood to it. Reminds me of Enigma comics from the 90s.', '2007-07-20 16:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922226, 555681, 50695, '<td valign="top">I find this difficulat to believe. If his name were really Lincoln they wouldn''t call him "Link." They would call him "The Log."</td>', 'I find this difficulat to believe. If his name were really Lincoln they wouldn''t call him "Link." They would call him "The Log."', '2007-07-20 16:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922232, 555641, 50695, '<td valign="top">The title is silly. For me, the missing link is a purely visual one. We want to link the hand to the face in a different way. Here they are blended instead of linked. There were not many creative interpretations of the challenge, so I appreciate this!</td>', 'The title is silly. For me, the missing link is a purely visual one. We want to link the hand to the face in a different way. Here they are blended instead of linked. There were not many creative interpretations of the challenge, so I appreciate this!', '2007-07-20 16:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922240, 554129, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is such a beautiful photo that I can find my own missing links. This photo is a meditation on what is missing.</td>', 'This is such a beautiful photo that I can find my own missing links. This photo is a meditation on what is missing.', '2007-07-20 16:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922242, 555122, 50695, '<td valign="top">Excellent interpretation of the challenge. I tried to do something similar in a Free Study and I bombed.</td>', 'Excellent interpretation of the challenge. I tried to do something similar in a Free Study and I bombed.', '2007-07-20 16:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
