(3926924, 555283, 50034, '<td valign="top">Would <b>the missing link</b> be the connection between the girl and the flowers?  If so, great portrait with a subtle, but very clear message!  Good Job!  :)  Or another possibility, Did she have some apocryphal relationship with <b>Van Gogh</b> who painted <i>the Sunflowers</i>?  (Sorry, I know that''s a stretch, but it was FUN playing!)  :}</td>', 'Would the missing link be the connection between the girl and the flowers?  If so, great portrait with a subtle, but very clear message!  Good Job!  :)  Or another possibility, Did she have some apocryphal relationship with Van Gogh who painted the Sunflowers?  (Sorry, I know that''s a stretch, but it was FUN playing!)  :}', '2007-07-22 23:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
