(3926983, 555532, 54540, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Great take on the theme.  Extra point!</td>', 'LOL!  Great take on the theme.  Extra point!', '2007-07-22 23:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3927010, 555472, 54540, '<td valign="top">L-I-N-K is missing, clever!  I''m just worried that many won''t get it.  Good luck though!  Extra point for the idea.<br/>(Really good depth of field by the way!)</td>', 'L-I-N-K is missing, clever!  I''m just worried that many won''t get it.  Good luck though!  Extra point for the idea.(Really good depth of field by the way!)', '2007-07-22 23:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3927036, 555122, 54540, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of the leap from birds to planes here.  Photographically, this image needs a solid depth of field (DOF) though, meaning the plane is just outside of the DOF.  My preference would have been to stop WAY DOWN (f/30+), to increase the area in focos.  Good cropping, and I like the desaturation for this image!  Good studio setup.</td>', 'I love the idea of the leap from birds to planes here.  Photographically, this image needs a solid depth of field (DOF) though, meaning the plane is just outside of the DOF.  My preference would have been to stop WAY DOWN (f/30+), to increase the area in focos.  Good cropping, and I like the desaturation for this image!  Good studio setup.', '2007-07-22 23:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3927057, 555349, 74371, '<td valign="top">Picture was well done, in focus, framed nicely and I kinda like it. But, although I try NOT to be a purist... the Challenge is "Missing Link". There ''should'' be some attempt to at least hint at the intended name of the challenge, I would think. Although I like your picture... I cannot in all fairness see any way that it pertains to this Challenge. Sorry! (4)</td>', 'Picture was well done, in focus, framed nicely and I kinda like it. But, although I try NOT to be a purist... the Challenge is "Missing Link". There ''should'' be some attempt to at least hint at the intended name of the challenge, I would think. Although I like your picture... I cannot in all fairness see any way that it pertains to this Challenge. Sorry! (4)', '2007-07-22 23:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3927060, 555376, 54540, '<td valign="top">Great colors in this shot.  It''s like the water keeps moving!</td>', 'Great colors in this shot.  It''s like the water keeps moving!', '2007-07-22 23:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
