(3927628, 554775, 76430, '<td valign="top">Welcome to DPC Coleman.  You did well on the photography here, but I think the main reason for your low score is your picture''s connection to the subject was too vague.  It''s a bit over-brightened.  This would have done much better in a challenge titled "Sticking out" or "Danger" for example.  You''ve got great depth of field and creative shooting angle.  Keep at it.  I''ve gotten in the bottom few twice out of the dozen or so entries I''ve submitted.</td>', 'Welcome to DPC Coleman.  You did well on the photography here, but I think the main reason for your low score is your picture''s connection to the subject was too vague.  It''s a bit over-brightened.  This would have done much better in a challenge titled "Sticking out" or "Danger" for example.  You''ve got great depth of field and creative shooting angle.  Keep at it.  I''ve gotten in the bottom few twice out of the dozen or so entries I''ve submitted.', '2007-07-23 02:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
