(3928418, 555324, 51538, '<td valign="top">Creating this image - or coming across it at the right time of day - you made everything work in harmony: the 28-135mm (which I owned for a while) is very apt for this lighting and type of scene; the gentle bokeh and colours remind me of a classic story-telling sort of photography style; the "I wonder what is over the hill" perspective view is not that common but always seductive in its implicit question.  All-in-all a subtle image I would have been torn about entering in such a challenge.  I''m glad to see that so many people ''got it.''</td>', 'Creating this image - or coming across it at the right time of day - you made everything work in harmony: the 28-135mm (which I owned for a while) is very apt for this lighting and type of scene; the gentle bokeh and colours remind me of a classic story-telling sort of photography style; the "I wonder what is over the hill" perspective view is not that common but always seductive in its implicit question.  All-in-all a subtle image I would have been torn about entering in such a challenge.  I''m glad to see that so many people ''got it.''', '2007-07-23 11:46:46.000000', NULL, 0),
